{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EEHTv1MUmiAj61Xrrweuf5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- v4-fixed-inject25（准备中）\\\\n- v4-fixed-inject10（准备中）\\\\n- v4-recovery-eval-dev: Recovery eval pipeline development — inject errors during eval to test if TaxEI models recover better than random/vanilla (Option C from D009)（准备中）\\\\n- v4-recovery-dryrun: D010 Phase 2 前置: Recovery eval --inject 模式 dry-run, 1-2 tasks 验证 pipeline 正常工作（准备中）\\\\n- v4-random-eval: v4 Random SFT eval — formal Gate 3b judgment, same-source 9,029 samples, checkpoint-3387（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-eval: v4 TaxEI SFT eval — formal Gate 3a/3b judgment, same-source 9,029 samples, checkpoint-3387（准备中）\\\\n- v4-vanilla-eval-r3: v4 Vanilla SFT eval r3 — dynamic checkpoint lookup with sort -V, adapter_config.json pre-check（准备中）\\\\n- v4-vanilla-eval-r2: v4 Vanilla SFT eval retry — fixed --device cuda:0 (was --gpu 0) + explicit checkpoint-1635（准备中）\\\\n- v4-random-sft-r2: v4 Random SFT retry (r2) — same-source 9,029 samples, formal Gate 3b. Previous run killed by SIGHUP.（准备中）\\\\n- v4-taxei-sft-r2: v4 TaxEI SFT retry (r2) — same-source 9,029 samples, formal Gate 3a/3b. Previous run killed by SIGHUP.（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 16 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval** (success): v4 Random 50% injection fixed-size eval — 47 tasks clean eval. 与 TaxEI 50% (51.1%) 对比。Random dose-response 最后一点。\\\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval** (success): v4 Random 25% injection fixed-size eval — 47 ALFWorld tasks (clean). 与 TaxEI 25% (48.9%) 对比。 ← 基于 v4-random-fixed-inject25\\\\n- **v4-random-fixed-inject25** (success): v4 Random fixed-size ablation: 25% injection (4,358 total). 与 TaxEI 25% (48.9%) 对比 taxonomy 标签在中等注入比例下是否有差异。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 28 / 负向 5 / 失败 1 / 共 35\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- v4-vanilla-seed7: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- v4-taxei-fixed-inject25: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1836, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011LC8gAQszf1d7vJJhFsLYB","session_id":"a93e6455-f184-4ae1-aabe-3c851fdec0e9","uuid":"e4dd4684-54a6-4094-a247-e214a7f1d016","timestamp":"2026-05-15T03:05:54.521Z"}
